  "hypothesis": "Use contextual graded counterfactual route information, not binary missing-peer evidence: enumerate all PUBLIC decoded role-ordered target paths and measure best and second-distinct path Hamming continuity cost, then veto only original accepted graphs whose best path incurs nonzero continuity cost and is weakly separated from an alternative publicly traversable route. Only PUBLIC graph values, nodes, and ordered roles; no source oracle, generator family token, hidden operator/key or edit location.",
